<title>USA: SOCCER-DENMARK, MEXICO POST WINS IN U.S. CUP TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DENMARK, MEXICO POST WINS IN U.S. CUP TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>PASADENA, California 1997-01-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>U.S. Cup soccer tournament on Sunday:</p>
<p>Denmark beat Peru 2-1 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Denmark - Soren Andersen (8th minute), Soren Colding</p>
<p>(81st)</p>
<p>Peru - Nolberto Solano Todco (51st)</p>
<p>Mexico beat United States 2-0 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Mexico - Luis Roberto Alves (3rd minute), Alberto Garcia</p>
<p>Aspe, 68th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 31,725</p>
</text>
